<title>NEW ZEALAND: Queen Charlotte 1st half profit NZ$33,000.</title>
<headline>Queen Charlotte 1st half profit NZ$33,000.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to December 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    0.03 vs 1.51 loss</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    nil vs same</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    nil vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover			     0.054 vs 8.37</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			0.052 vs 1.51 loss</p>
<p>Note - Queen Charlotte Holdings Ltd, formerly Regal Salmon Ltd, completed the sale of its business assets to Tsiong Group subsidiary Southern Ocean Seafoods Ltd last year. The company said it was continuing the search for new business opportunities. Tax losses of NZ$3 million remain to carry forward. A call notice now being prepared at NZ$0.15/share, due date March 24, will increase available funds by NZ$4.1 million after expenses.</p>
</text>
